# Conformance probe pack used as an inner pack: a text read through a table
# that has an entry for 1 only (spec 0.34 ruling 23). Public. No kinds.
format     conformance-inner-viascalar
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
map     tags  1  one
field   probe.s1  8  uint  via tags
